#: scenario:scenario_967DE099_5F16_462D_B99A_86EEAB3FE548
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 814306917c7f2834e07d3ff59d95edad12228cadedb9a03478d7c6a7b9e1368a
#. default-sha256: 3b52ca2c0d42f99c9b2085313eb96a52295eeefe89e6510c407530a6fcf1a76b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_967DE099_5F16_462D_B99A_86EEAB3FE548"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫............"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫…………。"

#: scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b32b4ba9289f07e31cbc6b070b5d38cbb859d264a916fd96dd5c197f3c109eb6
#. default-sha256: f7093c4683b4acd25ab89a2db443618c2d7d28f3d57636f27a1eb2e1f3196c14
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, now, Nellie.⟪k:1⟫You love the theatre, so don’t look so cross."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ねえ、⟪k:1⟫ネリーってば。⟪k:2⟫そんな不機嫌そうな顔をしていないでさあ。⟪k:3⟫せっかく君が好きな"
"演劇に足を伸ばしたというのに。"

#: scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f48824703194d7e85d87b69b380dfa8b21b45dab8be61bae3ac9b125deaeae5a
#. default-sha256: 06fc8e30af46eaf6a5409f6432ecbef6b9c2b8ba90cfe5aaf9f70e0870793afa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmph."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……ふん、⟪k:3⟫だ。"

#: scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 784f3ac2f5bd5b9c9a5dd16951b68599fcfa19e4bd4707381a42839c1a6ad08e
#. default-sha256: 3f8600299e241f2a012e550e10707f0b5a13ecf8bc719bd70011defc993aa702
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was out with a man other than her brother that evening—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a rare sight indeed. "
"⟪k:3⟫And she was quite clearly in a foul mood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その日ネリーは、⟪k:1⟫珍しく兄ではない男性と出かけておりました。⟪k:2⟫しかし見ればわかるよう"
"に、⟪k:3⟫彼女は不機嫌そのもの。"

#: scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f105d77f95e8cef401c133c9e5e499590dd092aa61aa778d0893e59c1d14c9d
#. default-sha256: e53aded21fcd8c17c753332698510c7fcfe92be0b8af73f327246fae7d5abb8d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I will ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ stand for this...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That I should have to marry a man as "
"disagreeable as Arthur!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫It’s unthinkable!)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫（絶対認めないんだから……。⟪k:1⟫こんな奴が……よりによって嫌味なアーサーが婚約者なんて！）"

#: scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9e454e248393212bb140245622062152b0cf685393f725b56389c550b27ca47
#. default-sha256: 65ab1c4cf28aa2a208f99ebae1a4e8874746478bed0711cd3884dcd5eeb9ff81
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The young man at her side was Nellie’s fiancé, selected by her parents."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女の隣にいる男性は、⟪k:1⟫ご両親が決めた結婚相手だったのです。"

#: scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a902e1080ca00e9825ad7771706465b6a5ee44b3c9dee74965114afbe105dad0
#. default-sha256: 6c84f100366d0784f0a7ea3bbd45068aace67ef194f5ac16ab812b2b82c8347d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On any other occasion, she would have snubbed an invitation from any man who was not Mell, "
"but she had little say in this matter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫普段であれば男性からの誘いは突っぱねるネリーでしたが、⟪k:1⟫さすがに、⟪k:2⟫こればかりはどうし"
"ようもなく……。"

#: scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79245475c301fe6893aed1fbeb6216f31c726d86430d29e786d2347dfd420ed0
#. default-sha256: 8f99d23fea720c0c014498f0f70c5894d6b731f7c0d9e3ae378afe6b73b6a0aa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was, for lack of a better word, ⟪k:1⟫forced⟪k:2⟫ to go out with him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ほぼ強制的に、⟪k:1⟫外に出されてしまったのですわ。"

#: scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 417fc988350adde1018168ed1c70cbb9bcb2d3c968b2651dc3db9056e4594066
#. default-sha256: 39041c4acfe5d3cbf006fb01ed0a3ff90c8f15d9adf4f3c9f45ebc6fc5175b1b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And oh, how furiously she had fought against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ええ、⟪k:1⟫その時の彼女の荒れようといったら、⟪k:2⟫すさまじかったのです。"

#: scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9dc0abd3652d40eafbb0ca0481eb68d3cb82107e3fbebcf0ca602fa0ff20e5e4
#. default-sha256: 510080e8a80f76e79bf554404049d5585d08739ee6ace05c10d8e6c8a9e278a6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had shoved aside the abigail trying to fasten her corset, locked herself in her room, "
"and sobbed for quite some time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫コルセットを締めようとする侍女を突き飛ばし、⟪k:1⟫部屋の中に立てこもり、⟪k:2⟫泣き喚き……。"

#: scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aeff95f34c795a4a68303e00f72e80c14bfe04f3354a4a68f6cf4fcd774127ce
#. default-sha256: 24049a49d5c89958141e7fdf608b63c777689f34f67d8d301e07d33dd701965d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It required the combined efforts of several of us to get her ready and out the door for her "
"date."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それでも数人がかりで彼女に支度をさせて、⟪k:1⟫婚約者との……そう、⟪k:2⟫デートですわね、⟪k:3⟫そち"
"らに向かわせたのです。"

#: scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce1bf2b663b87da10c3d4f0c8bb0786dd5a5f1ec2f8baad3fe9065a259412fb9
#. default-sha256: 3f450cd94cfa854d57aea10f8a10066e9e48eebe2877051a016374a683f20b66
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Come now, you should at least ⟪k:4⟫pretend⟪k:5⟫ you’re enjoying yourself.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Or do you want people to think we don’t get along?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ねえねえ、⟪k:4⟫もっと楽しそうにしてくれなきゃ困るよ。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫仲が悪いって思"
"われるだろ？"

#: scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e25dd1cfa3bf25bcc5e87d754c322eb2a222cf459c2d8d9b137ee5aaf897e21f
#. default-sha256: e5f9921eed8ddfe9163e49a06c4d4a11635a58ec1ca25aa8cd81f29d097b0954
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do⟪k:3⟫ we get along?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫実際、⟪k:2⟫仲なんて良くないじゃない。"

#: scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: beaeee7ac194707c74ce5cfd333979cfe889e1be785daf2f7f22120f561c818c
#. default-sha256: ec931ed1b660808904bed56fb780f1f091f32770c3e14a9ee08852215d01e003
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well... ⟪k:3⟫I want to, for what it’s worth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫やれやれ……僕は君と仲良くしたいと思っているけどなあ。"

#: scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12b0b33ad8f24c1ed1e216764e610d2e86d7d993bd4ac275c569bc9e16cb1bb3
#. default-sha256: 4949f64f20e6ce75ed99f63cea2038cc59a9462a7be1a26ce70772fcd4a9e345
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What it’s “worth” to you is my ⟪k:2⟫name⟪k:3⟫, not me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あなたが仲良くしたいのは、⟪k:2⟫ネリーじゃなくて、⟪k:3⟫うちの家柄でしょ……。"

#: scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 267ccde14c0ca5ca90efdae7d57236cb8cafd57621f5bdd2d4a4b0f8ab279a5a
#. default-sha256: 91854cbc1ecfe389ddde231181facc3b82c27bf03e955ac5c3f283f081ec145d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you really going to be like that?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I went out of my way to take you to "
"your favorite play.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The least you could do is be a little kinder to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫そんなこと言う？⟪k:3⟫　折角君の好きな演目に付き合ってるんだ、⟪k:4⟫もう少し愛想良く"
"してくれないとさ。"

#: scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 791b7f25ed18eeb13744cd6176beaca477df1100e3fd611e642bf60d3516c73e
#. default-sha256: e721c9f455a30f6c339ab77ffed870381cdb08b4ae58c49e7f2503183efada1a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was it called again... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Romeo and Juliet⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫It’s been running for six "
"or seven years now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この演目……ロミオとジュリエットだっけ、⟪k:1⟫もう六年だか七年くらい繰り返されてるだろ。"

#: scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a1a4360887d73861fc12af12752e7269b3cd5bdb884af9c1b3185713b88ddd3
#. default-sha256: 9e3ff5bcda7aa3caf34a9860a6347384cc957dc1a23a7caf71ea7f1043e8f7db
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A family like yours or mine could pay to have a brand new script written."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫僕や君くらいの家名があるなら、⟪k:1⟫脚本家に新しい作品くらい書かせられるっていうのに。"

#: scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2a9d324d512d8edfdd934488f4ff46f6fd68b6965dd0c616ebf09ec6640187a
#. default-sha256: 6704f3b999711b451954f3f38c87aacdc30d4d99f357e3e45220d35c06ecf0b6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So why should we have to see an old play at a theatre full of ⟪k:1⟫commoners⟪k:2⟫? ⟪k:3⟫It "
"may be private, but even so... ⟪k:4⟫Haah... ⟪k:5⟫I would rather just have a show put on at my "
"estate—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫どうしてまた、⟪k:1⟫私設劇場とは言っても、⟪k:2⟫中流階級ばっかりいるような劇場で見るかなあ……。"
"⟪k:3⟫ハ～ア、⟪k:4⟫演劇なら僕の屋敷でやれば――"

#: scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fce9427a74a1242ff30c56f7e5d77d8bc85ea29a5693b3e2a8b69a3bbc724f7e
#. default-sha256: 0ea5ffc17af9232540a0f8c0ee7f5bcdeb2ca16286a28f7489f50e12de779726
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Stop talking already!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫――うるさいわねッ！"

#: scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2b02ce0915417c3e55619f1d486eaccbe2c5110326adaf50a406ed0cbee3b33
#. default-sha256: 30b67c7cfdc683d9439d452ebc8efd774c49bfd99b9248654ceb0770cadb4dc0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why should I— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why should I have to marry someone like you?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I have "
"ab-⟪k:6⟫so-⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫lutely⟪k:9⟫ no desire to marry you!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あんたみたいな……あんたみたいな奴と、⟪k:2⟫どうしてネリーが結婚しなくちゃならないの！？"
"⟪k:3⟫　ネリーはぜったい、⟪k:4⟫ぜーーったい嫌だから！"

#: scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd1411e06e00fa92f2dc5a7304e8eb62764fe2f6308367179a0945d41f6ef483
#. default-sha256: 8aa94cb6dfd63043d60000ebc7cee1f07a0160cdc38677cac1289864d5097d12
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whatever it takes, I ⟪k:1⟫will⟪k:2⟫ put a stop to this!⟪k:3⟫I’ll talk to Father as many "
"times as I must!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何としてでもやめさせるわ！⟪k:1⟫　お父さまに何度だって言うもの！！"

#: scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 908e29a4e466f9595ac6675f135cbab28ecf9db574b020b1fcf698fc1ed56eb8
#. default-sha256: a22567ebc3aae18e4de321836fb5ed16d95994cd83b5eccffea40173efd56a35
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Please, don’t make such a scene. It’s shameful.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There are people around; "
"remember, you represent your family."
msgstr ""
